{"id":"n27365-1-31","stage":1,"title":"말씀 · 话","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n27365-1-31-1","ko":"이번 일을 어떤 방법으로 진행시킬지 모두 구체적으로 말씀을 해 주세요.","zh":"请大家具体说说，打算用哪种方法来推进这次工作。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"이번","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}},{"text":"일을","meaning":"事，工作","explanation":"일：事，工作；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"일","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"91895","senseId":"5","lemma":"일","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"일을","audio":"/audio/9a5fd6c2b18669a93295.mp3"}},{"text":"어떤","meaning":"哪一个","explanation":"어떤：哪一个","readings":[{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17185","senseId":"2","lemma":"어떤","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어떤","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3"}},{"text":"방법으로","meaning":"方法，办法","explanation":"방법：方法，办法；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"방법","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"65531","senseId":"1","lemma":"방법","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"방법으로","audio":"/audio/3e4bb489b72ac49f3435.mp3"}},{"text":"진행시킬지","meaning":"进行，进展","explanation":"진행：进行，进展；시키：使前面的行为发生，表示“使、让、促成”。；ㄹ지：引入未确定的信息、间接疑问或选择：“是否、怎么、何时”等。","readings":[{"term":"진행","audio":"/audio/52e94db6f68c7bdf0f11.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29010","senseId":"2","lemma":"진행","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"진행시킬지","audio":"/audio/6581aecfeded8df1afa5.mp3"}},{"text":"모두","meaning":"全部，所有","explanation":"모두：全部，所有","readings":[{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64739","senseId":"1","lemma":"모두","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"모두","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3"}},{"text":"구체적으로","meaning":"具体的，切实的","explanation":"구체적：具体的，切实的；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"구체적","audio":"/audio/b3bef5fa2aa9a1953855.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60098","senseId":"2","lemma":"구체적","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구체적으로","audio":"/audio/a3fd47e273eb9d6a8fcf.mp3"}},{"text":"말씀을","meaning":"话","explanation":"말씀：话；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"말씀","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27365","senseId":"1","lemma":"말씀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"말씀을","audio":"/audio/811db8d2a0505d9ba919.mp3"}},{"text":"해","meaning":"做，干","explanation":"하다：做，干；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"하다","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"73277","senseId":"1","lemma":"하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"해","audio":"/audio/b4ec4274b7799f1f17e5.mp3"}},{"text":"주세요.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"주세요","audio":"/audio/97f2a1d4f468faba426d.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"dfc76879e2f5c3ea","term":"일","zh":"事，工作","audio":"/audio/dfc76879e2f5c3ead091.mp3","entryId":"91895","definition":"需要解决或处理的问题或事项。","pronunciation":["일ː"]},{"id":"a0307911a0fb4256","term":"어떤","zh":"哪一个","audio":"/audio/a0307911a0fb42568a78.mp3","entryId":"17185","definition":"用于询问在现有的多个人或事物中，作为对象的是什么。","pronunciation":["어떤"]},{"id":"a4a801d526fb2511","term":"방법","zh":"方法，办法","audio":"/audio/a4a801d526fb251193b0.mp3","entryId":"65531","definition":"处理某事的手段或方式。","pronunciation":["방법"]},{"id":"52e94db6f68c7bdf","term":"진행","zh":"进行，进展","audio":"/audio/52e94db6f68c7bdf0f11.mp3","entryId":"29010","definition":"事等继续做下去。","pronunciation":["진ː행"]},{"id":"2576dfb09ecb81b9","term":"모두","zh":"全部，所有","audio":"/audio/2576dfb09ecb81b98258.mp3","entryId":"64739","definition":"一个不剩或一个不漏的全体。","pronunciation":["모두"]},{"id":"b3bef5fa2aa9a195","term":"구체적","zh":"具体的，切实的","audio":"/audio/b3bef5fa2aa9a1953855.mp3","entryId":"60098","definition":"实际详细。","pronunciation":["구체적"]},{"id":"9fa325aa12d3fdd0","term":"말씀","zh":"话","audio":"/audio/9fa325aa12d3fdd01819.mp3","entryId":"27365","definition":"(敬语)别人的言语。","pronunciation":["말ː씀"]},{"id":"505de0a2f6be73fa","term":"하다","zh":"做，干","audio":"/audio/505de0a2f6be73fa7758.mp3","entryId":"73277","definition":"做，干","pronunciation":["하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/35982e14db2fb3d813b2.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n27365-1-31-2","ko":"그럼 저부터 말하겠습니다.","zh":"那我就先来说明一下。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그럼","meaning":"那么，既然那样","explanation":"그럼：那么，既然那样","readings":[{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60346","senseId":"2","lemma":"그럼","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"그럼","audio":"/audio/86f87d3fb9919f145d21.mp3"}},{"text":"저부터","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；부터：表示起点：“从……起”。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"저부터","audio":"/audio/44d465a3961270cb6b53.mp3"}},{"text":"말하겠습니다.","meaning":"说，讲","explanation":"말하다：说，讲；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；습니다：正式礼貌的陈述句末。","readings":[{"term":"